% F45-ABORT: DEFECT 45.  BPUSH AND #A NAMED THE USER VARIABLE ABORT, WHICH
% ONLY PUSHES ITS CELL, SO "STACK OVERFLOW." AND "OUTPUT CONVERSION ERROR."
% DID NOT END THE LINE.  PATCHED, THEY RUN THE INSTALLED ABORT, HERE MYABORT.
DECIMAL
'MYABORT : "MYABORT" MSG CR I_ABORT ;
() MYABORT ABORT !
"A" MSG 0 <# 41 ( 35 #PUT ) "NOT REACHED" MSG CR
"B" MSG 10 #A TYO "NOT REACHED" MSG CR
"C" MSG -10 #A TYO 9 #A TYO CR
12345 = CR
